From e21e7e40f6aed177713df375f28c18a64fd81e30 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Pang Jiming <discrete_brain@163.com>
Date: Tue, 16 Jun 2026 20:49:46 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 06/43] feat(smap): support 4K page scanning for KVM virtual
 machines

Add kernel-level 4K-VM support by introducing a process_type module
parameter to distinguish processes from VMs at scan time. Implement 4K
page table walk and KVM memslot scanning for VMs using 4K pages,
alongside the existing 2M hugepage path.

Remove the userspace QEMU task type check to allow 4K-VM processes to
be managed without requiring hugepage VMA detection.
